#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:14
msgid "Building a real-time Linux kernel [community-contributed] - tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:17
msgid ""
"A real-time Linux kernel can improve scheduling behavior for latency-"
"sensitive ROS systems. This article explains how to download, patch, "
"configure, build, and install a ``PREEMPT_RT`` kernel on Ubuntu. After you "
"follow it, you can boot into the new kernel and verify that it is running."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:29
msgid ""
"This tutorial begins with a clean Ubuntu 20.04.1 install on Intel x86_64. "
"Actual kernel is 5.4.0-54-generic, but we will install the Latest Stable "
"RT_PREEMPT Version. To build the kernel you need at least 30GB free disk "
"space."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:33
msgid ""
"Check `this wiki <https://wiki.linuxfoundation.org/realtime/start>`_ for the "
"latest stable version, at the time of writing this is \"Latest Stable "
"Version 5.4-rt\". If we click on the `link <http://cdn.kernel.org/pub/linux/"
"kernel/projects/rt/5.4/>`_, we get the exact version. Currently it is "
"``patch-5.4.78-rt44.patch.gz``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:39
msgid "We create a directory in our home dir with"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:41
msgid "$ mkdir ~/kernel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:45
msgid "and switch into it with"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:47
msgid "$ cd ~/kernel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:51
msgid ""
"We can go with a browser to `this page <https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/"
"linux/kernel/v5.x/>`_ and see if the version is there. You can download it "
"from the site and move it manually from /Downloads to the /kernel folder, or "
"download it using wget by right clicking the link using \"copy link "
"location\". Example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:55
msgid ""
"$ wget https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v5.x/linux-5.4.78."
"tar.gz"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:59
#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:71
msgid "unpack it with"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:61
msgid "$ tar -xzf linux-5.4.78.tar.gz"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:65
msgid ""
"download rt_preempt patch matching the Kernel version we just downloaded "
"over at `kernel.org <http://cdn.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/5.4/"
">`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:67
msgid ""
"$ wget http://cdn.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/5.4/older/"
"patch-5.4.78-rt44.patch.gz"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:73
msgid "$ gunzip patch-5.4.78-rt44.patch.gz"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:77
msgid "Then switch into the linux directory with"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:79
msgid "$ cd linux-5.4.78/"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:83
msgid "and patch the kernel with the realtime patch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:85
msgid "$ patch -p1 < ../patch-5.4.78-rt44.patch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:89
msgid ""
"We simply want to use the config of our Ubuntu installation, so we get the "
"Ubuntu config with"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:91
msgid "$ cp /boot/config-5.4.0-54-generic .config"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:95
msgid ""
"Open Software & Updates. in the Ubuntu Software menu tick the 'Source code' "
"box"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:98
msgid "We need some tools to build kernel, install them with"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:100
msgid ""
"$ sudo apt-get build-dep linux\n"
"$ sudo apt-get install libncurses-dev flex bison openssl libssl-dev dkms "
"libelf-dev libudev-dev libpci-dev libiberty-dev autoconf fakeroot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:105
msgid "To enable all Ubuntu configurations, we simply use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:107
msgid "$ yes '' | make oldconfig"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:111
msgid "Then we need to enable rt_preempt in the kernel. We call"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:114
msgid "$ make menuconfig"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:118
msgid "and set the following"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:120
msgid ""
"# Enable CONFIG_PREEMPT_RT\n"
" -> General Setup\n"
"  -> Preemption Model (Fully Preemptible Kernel (Real-Time))\n"
"   (X) Fully Preemptible Kernel (Real-Time)\n"
"\n"
"# Enable CONFIG_HIGH_RES_TIMERS\n"
" -> General setup\n"
"  -> Timers subsystem\n"
"   [*] High Resolution Timer Support\n"
"\n"
"# Enable CONFIG_NO_HZ_FULL\n"
" -> General setup\n"
"  -> Timers subsystem\n"
"   -> Timer tick handling (Full dynticks system (tickless))\n"
"    (X) Full dynticks system (tickless)\n"
"\n"
"# Set CONFIG_HZ_1000 (note: this is no longer in the General Setup menu, go "
"back twice)\n"
" -> Processor type and features\n"
"  -> Timer frequency (1000 HZ)\n"
"   (X) 1000 HZ\n"
"\n"
"# Set CPU_FREQ_DEFAULT_GOV_PERFORMANCE [=y]\n"
" ->  Power management and ACPI options\n"
"  -> CPU Frequency scaling\n"
"   -> CPU Frequency scaling (CPU_FREQ [=y])\n"
"    -> Default CPUFreq governor (<choice> [=y])\n"
"     (X) performance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:150
msgid ""
"Save and exit menuconfig. Now we're going to build the kernel which will "
"take quite some time. (10-30min on a modern cpu)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:154
msgid "$ make -j `nproc` deb-pkg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:158
msgid "After the build is finished check the deb packages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:160
msgid ""
"$ ls ../*deb\n"
"../linux-headers-5.4.78-rt41_5.4.78-rt44-1_amd64.deb  ../linux-image-5.4.78-"
"rt44-dbg_5.4.78-rt44-1_amd64.deb\n"
"../linux-image-5.4.78-rt41_5.4.78-rt44-1_amd64.deb    ../linux-libc-"
"dev_5.4.78-rt44-1_amd64.deb"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:166
msgid "Then we install all kernel deb packages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:168
msgid "$ sudo dpkg -i ../*.deb"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:172
msgid "Now the real time kernel should be installed. Reboot the system:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:175
msgid "$ sudo reboot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:179
msgid "And check the new kernel version:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2/Building-Realtime-rt_preempt-kernel-for-ROS-2.rst:181
msgid ""
"$ uname -a\n"
"Linux ros2host 5.4.78-rt44 #1 SMP PREEMPT_RT Fri Nov 6 10:37:59 CET 2020 "
"x86_64 xx"
msgstr ""
